meta {
  name: Remove Scope from Entry
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.ScopeService/RemoveScopeFromEntry
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "entryId": "{{entryId}}",
    "scopeId": "{{scopeId}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # Remove Scope from Entry

  Removes a scope association from a translation entry.

  ## Request
  - `entryId` (required): The UUID of the entry
  - `scopeId` (required): The UUID of the scope to remove

  ## Behavior
  - Removes the many-to-many relationship between entry and scope
  - No error if the association doesn't exist
  - Both entry and scope must exist

  ## Response
  Returns an empty response on success.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {}
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: entry id or scope id is required
  - `NOT_FOUND`: entry or scope not found
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to remove scope from entry
}
